# Product Context: Bookings & Payments (B&P / YGB)

> This file provides business, product, and team context for working on the Bookings & Payments codebase and design system. It is intended as a reference for designers and developers onboarding to the product.

---

## 1. Company & Product Background

**Trackman** is a sports technology company best known for its golf launch monitor hardware and software ecosystem (simulators, ranges, the Trackman Golf App, and the Trackman Portal).

**Your Golf Booking (YGB)** is a UK-founded booking and payments platform that Trackman acquired a few years ago. It was originally built as a standalone SaaS product for golf venues (driving ranges, indoor simulator centres, golf clubs). Post-acquisition, YGB became the engine behind **Bookings & Payments (B&P)** — Trackman's official booking and payments solution for facility operators.

B&P is embedded inside the **Trackman Portal** as an iFrame, giving Trackman customers access to it within their existing ecosystem while YGB continues to run as an independent backend service.

> **Key nuance:** YGB still has its own non-Trackman customers and operates under its own brand identity, codebase, and design system. It is not yet fully merged with Trackman.

---

## 2. What the Product Does

B&P serves as the **operational and financial layer** for golf venues in the Trackman ecosystem. It consists of four core products:

| Product | Description |
|---|---|
| **Bookings – Range** | Bay booking management for driving ranges (Classic View: fixed duration, high bay count) |
| **Bookings – Indoor** | Bay booking for indoor simulator venues (Calendar View: variable duration, fewer bays) |
| **Point of Sale (POS)** | In-venue product sales, upselling at time of booking, staff-facing |
| **Tee Sheets** | Booking management for minigolf, footgolf, and outdoor golf courses |

### Core capabilities
- Scheduling and management of bays, courses, and events
- Customer accounts, memberships, and subscription management
- Payment processing via Adyen, Square, and other integrated processors
- Hardware integrations: ball dispensers (Range Servant, Select PI, EGM, E-Range, Amtech, GolfMore, Badcock, RAS), smart locks (Openpath/Avigilon), and Trackman simulator hardware
- GolfNow distribution integration
- Online booking (web + Trackman Golf App) and walk-in/admin booking flows

### System hierarchy (data model)
```
Organization (Legal Entity)
└── Venues (Physical Locations)
    ├── Ranges / Simulators / Courses
    │   ├── Bays / Holes (Bookable Units)
    │   └── Bay Options / Course Options / Player Options
    ├── Memberships / Discounts / Flags
    ├── Products & Extras
    └── Payment Configurations / Methods / Invoices / Subscriptions
```

### Two admin environments
| Environment | URL | Used by |
|---|---|---|
| **Venue Admin** | `/booking-and-payments/admin` | Venue managers, staff — daily ops, bookings, POS, memberships |
| **Organization Admin** | `/booking-and-payments/org` | Org owners, franchise managers — company-wide settings, payment config, billing |

