## 3. Users

Three distinct user types interact with the product:

| User | Interface | Goals |
|---|---|---|
| **Organization Owner / Franchise Manager** | `/org` admin | Multi-venue oversight, payment integrations, invoicing |
| **Venue Manager / Staff** | `/admin` | Daily bookings, POS sales, customer management |
| **Golfer / End User** | Public booking pages, Trackman Golf App, in-venue kiosks | Book sessions, buy products, manage their account |

