## 8. Key Terminology

| Term | Meaning |
|---|---|
| **YGB** | Your Golf Booking — the original product and underlying infrastructure |
| **B&P** | Bookings & Payments — the Trackman-branded version of YGB |
| **The Portal** | Trackman's main customer-facing platform (web app); B&P is embedded here |
| **TM Golf App** | Trackman's end-user mobile app; used for player-facing bookings |
| **TPS** | Trackman Performance Studio — the simulator software that integrates with B&P for bay locking/unlocking |
| **Org Admin** | Organisation-level admin environment (`/org`) |
| **Venue Admin** | Venue-level admin environment (`/admin`) |
| **Bay** | A bookable unit within a venue (simulator bay, range bay) |
| **Classic View** | Booking UI for ranges — fixed duration, availability shown per time slot |
| **Calendar View** | Booking UI for indoor venues — variable duration, full-day availability shown |
